# =============================================================================
# .gitattributes — Merge isolation for TRIP Planner project
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Files marked with `merge=ours` will NEVER overwrite the main-branch version
#   when merging from UAT. Git will silently keep the main branch copy.
#   This ensures AI/Jira agent code stays isolated in UAT only.
#
# HOW IT WORKS:
#   When you run `git merge uat` on main:
#     - App code (frontend, backend API) → merges normally ✅
#     - AI/Jira scripts below → main branch version is preserved ✅
#
# REQUIREMENT: The `merge.ours` driver must be configured locally (one-time):
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
# =============================================================================

